The Devon Energy cycle shows a buy on May 9&l;sup&g;th&l;/sup&g;. In the last year, nine of the ten buy signals have been profitable. This favorable development is likely to lift the share price closer to the $40-$42 area by May 17&l;sup&g;th&l;/sup&g;.
